  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Nayruuu/NgSharp",
  "published": "2026-07-21T13:01:22.747Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0: rewritten as an immutable AST + stateless renderer. Zero third-party dependencies — AngleSharp replaced by a purpose-built HTML template parser (analyzer-verified trim/Native-AOT-clean core; ~3x faster cold-start). @if/@else/@else if/@for control-flow, && / || operators, per-template AST cache (HtmlBuilder.Compile), NgElement.FromObject fast path. BREAKING: IPipe.Transform/IComponent.Render/IDirective.Apply no longer take an AngleSharp IElement (pipes take a tag-name string, components return their HTML, directives mutate a DirectiveElement); the map component moved to the separate NgSharp.Map package; NgElement.Children/Properties are now IReadOnlyList/IReadOnlyDictionary.",
